        <activityName xml:lang="en">Scantling, softwood, average, at plant, with resource correction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Scantling, softwood, average, at plant, with resource correction
This is an average of massive and laminated scantling according to the use of scantling in four window manufactures in Switerland;
UUID: ae23d723-b6c4-382f-86d2-de192005762e
Included are the materials used in a average scantling. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at scantling producers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ae23d723-b6c4-382f-86d2-de192005762e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
